# 构建上下文排除：减小镜像构建上下文体积，避免把本地工具链/构建产物打入镜像
.git
.gitignore
.vscode
.tools
tools-local
**/target
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/.vite
*.log
logs
evidence
data
.env
.env.local
application-local.yml
*.sqlite
*.db
deploy/k8s
# 证书仅通过卷挂载，不进构建上下文
deploy/gateway/certs/*.crt
deploy/gateway/certs/*.key
deploy/gateway/certs/*.pem
